      "side": 1,
      "message": "This appears to be an error in the Intel ADLRVP baseboard.  This platform uses the FUSB302 TCPC which sets [VBUS_MEASURE_TCPC](https://source.chromium.org/chromiumos/chromiumos/codesearch/+/HEAD:src/platform/ec/include/config.h;l\u003d6330)\n\nHowever, in the [charge manager](https://source.chromium.org/chromiumos/chromiumos/codesearch/+/HEAD:src/platform/ec/common/charge_manager.c;l\u003d372) the VBUS measure options are mutually exclusive.\n\nI\u0027ll upload a fix for the ADL boards that should resolve the build error you are seeing.",
